    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Lalaland, where you become a 15 years old witch name Alice who got into a huge debt because of her father. In order for you to save the young witch, you have to do</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/e6a9c1618bdd8e67819b7087744194fd.avif?t=1751408658\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span>Serving a costumer's unsystematically request with potions the have been made also of combining materials to make potions used to sale or finish quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/938830ce7daf44dd1e4b1df78ad08007.poster.avif?t=1751408658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/938830ce7daf44dd1e4b1df78ad08007.webm?t=1751408658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/938830ce7daf44dd1e4b1df78ad08007.mp4?t=1751408658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/64eff6a271426e31da001a6032ea8c7d.avif?t=1751408658\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span>Explore into the different dimension to Gathering a rare ingredients and defense yourself from the monster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360270/extras/03ea6efb7eee0bbfc90253a962cacfe9.avif?t=1751408658\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share